@baseUrl = http://localhost/prototipo/services/flights_ms/public
@token = {{token}}

### Listar vuelos (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar vuelos (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/flights/search?origin=Bogotá&destination=Medellín
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear vuelo (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/flights
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nave_id": 1,
  "origin": "Bogotá",
  "destination": "Cartagena",
  "departure": "2025-12-12 08:00",
  "arrival": "2025-12-12 09:40",
  "price": 320000
}

### Listar naves (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/naves
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear nave (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/naves
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Aeronave Demo",
  "capacity": 180,
  "model": "Airbus A320"
}

### Listar reservas (gestor o admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear reserva (gestor o admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "user_id": 2,
  "flight_id": 1
}

### Cancelar reserva (gestor o admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reservations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
